5902565502_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5ZYiAehgulcQ7kNvwGWBlBr&_nc_oc=AdpcE_ncVxBtTWzOaP9i8RxMxpFFiL3U74J-qBmEtdihMp_S_sifpvbq7Lki8TP46Ac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHRt_z5tYqFcYK05j6rFiaup6scL93n3gOURE35cXm0hQ&oe=6A8ACB63"}, {"file_name": "BLUD D.png", "id": "567194512633582", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003249_567194515966915_5134737270553800221_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qzf9zDY0XfEQ7kNvwEWC8aj&_nc_oc=Adqa_ZZ_SNzb0m7MGsZdFMQCUg_KaiAccZxVUtfWrxQ6z21Lgpy2t2nGZvZYWE8v0Jc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFRD8BTVZDlmk4FQ481z7TGYzVT3XA7cfu0H176i9OtBQ&oe=6A8AD9C6"}, {"file_name": "BLUD E.png", "id": "512750678316931", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974595_512750684983597_6316622060033192551_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FD6itoWReIsQ7kNvwHjPi2k&_nc_oc=AdoVTHFr_OBkgARagvFd984e6cosiOuRIXkf5cJxR7-Ek1p3qBG_AW1sfw_JoDrbtfc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGmfKLs4qyRW74RtqmkKYSJpTdynLSNt-dl4CncyERkGQ&oe=6A8ACD21"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BLUD trailer cover.png", "id": "1257187508752269", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75230049_1257187512085602_1909194995855667713_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gje9sB2qx9YQ7kNvwHSB4SM&_nc_oc=AdoW1qFfOUhmzQskfg8HznNT6u2Evr5-FK6VS6G6sCWlvWD2sB2ORAfOkr85dgLBWs4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE06GTcRgAqJPRupZ27RVw-imsZu2TTIKz4waViSA_arQ&oe=6A8AE2BB"}, "display_name": "BLUD", "keywords": ["gore", "violence", "guns", "sigma", "blood"], "long_description": "Unleash chaos and hilarity with BLUD, your very own mixed reality rage room! \nTurn your home into a battleground of absurd destruction, where colorful flying unicorns invade your space and only you can stop them.\n\n{1326912111658201}\n\n\"Bro woke up and chose violence\" \ud83e\udd84\n\n\n# Absurd Weapons\nGuns, chainsaws, crayons, and more \u2014 choose your tools of destruction and get creative with how you take down those pesky unicorns.\n\n{1140433681093627}\n\n\n\n# Multiple Game Modes\nWhether you're racing against time, pulling off trick shots, stopping a zombie outbreak, or focusing on one specific target (looking at you, Larry), there's a mode for every kind of chaos-lover.\n\n{544649441872261}\n\n# Endless Humor\nFeaturing Larry, a sarcastic talking unicorn with hundreds of hilarious lines, ready to taunt and entertain you throughout the madness.\n\n{1529351324437567}\n\n# 100% Mixed Reality\nExperience unicorn carnage in your own home as the game seamlessly blends your environment with a magical, blood-splattered battlefield.\n\n{1085416866703270}\n\n# Endless Fun\nEnjoy hours of replayable chaos that's perfect for showing off the power of mixed reality to friends and family.\n\nTransform your home into a wild, magical rage room and let the glitter, poop, and blood fly!\n\nAre you ready to paint your walls with unicorn blood?\n", "short_description": "Unleash chaos and hilarity with BLUD, your very own mixed reality rage room! \nTurn your home into a battleground of absurd destruction, where colorful flying unicorns invade your space and only you can stop them.\n\n\"Bro woke up and chose violence\" \ud83e\udd84"}]}, "developer_name": "No Ragrets Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/eula", "publisher_name": "No Ragrets Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/eula", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "externa